4em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable td,.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable th{border:0;padding:0}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"border-spacing:3px; width:30em;\"><caption class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></caption><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollss%C3%A4song\" title=\"Fotbollssäsong\">Säsong</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">2014</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Nya lag för säsongen</span></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna_United_DFF\" title=\"Eskilstuna United DFF\">Eskilstuna United</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Vinnare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a> <span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom: 1px dotted;\" title=\"9:e SM-titeln\">(9)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex BK</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Tyres%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Tyresö FF\">Tyresö FF</a> <small>(Till <a href=\"/wiki/Division_2_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_damer\" title=\"Division 2 i fotboll för damer\">division 2</a>)</small></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League\">Champions League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a><br /> <a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">KIF Örebro</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">110</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">323 (2,9 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anja_Mittag\" title=\"Anja Mittag\">Anja Mittag</a> (21 mål)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">K/Göteborg</a> 8–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex</a><br /><small>(5 juni)</small></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex</a> 0–8 <a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a><br /><small>(16 augusti)</small></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest mål i en match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">Rosengård</a> 7–1 <a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6_GIK\" title=\"Vittsjö GIK\">Vittsjö</a><br /><small>(16 april)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">K/Göteborg</a> 8–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex</a><br /><small>(5 juni)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex</a> 0–8 <a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a><br /><small>(16 augusti)</small></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest vunna matcher i rad</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">10 matcher<br /> <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest obesegrade matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">10 matcher<br /> <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest matcher utan vinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">20 matcher<br /> <a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex BK</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest förlorade i rad</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">20 matcher<br /> <a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex BK</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Högsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">5 221. <a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a> 2–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå</a><br /><small>(10 augusti)</small></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Lägsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">151. <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a> 0–3 <a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">Örebro</a> <br /><small>(27 september)</small></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">91 977</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">836</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2013\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2013\">2013</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2015\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2015\">2015</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Damallsvenskan 2014</b> var <a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\">Sveriges</a> högsta division i damfotboll 2014. Serien spelades under perioden 13 april-19 oktober 2014.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><br /> Nykomlingar för denna säsongen var <a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna_United_DFF\" title=\"Eskilstuna United DFF\">Eskilstuna United DFF</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a>. Mästare blev <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2014&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2014&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Lag\n</th>\n<th>Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Kapacitet\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Solna_kommun\" title=\"Solna kommun\">Solna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Skytteholms_IP\" title=\"Skytteholms IP\">Skytteholms IP</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;01800.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>1&#160;800\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna_United_DFF\" title=\"Eskilstuna United DFF\">Eskilstuna United DFF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna\" title=\"Eskilstuna\">Eskilstuna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tunavallen\" title=\"Tunavallen\">Tunavallen</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;07600.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>7&#160;600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6\" title=\"Malmö\">Malmö</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_IP\" title=\"Malmö IP\">Malmö IP</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;07600.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>7&#160;600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jitex_BK\" title=\"Jitex BK\">Jitex BK</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%B6lndal\" title=\"Mölndal\">Mölndal</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%85byvallen&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Åbyvallen [inte skriven än]\">Åbyvallen</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;02500.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>2&#160;500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">KIF Örebro</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro\" title=\"Örebro\">Örebro</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Behrn_Arena_(fotbollsanl%C3%A4ggning)\" title=\"Behrn Arena (fotbollsanläggning)\">Behrn Arena</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;012624.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>12&#160;624\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"Göteborg\">Göteborg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Valhalla_IP\" title=\"Valhalla IP\">Valhalla IP</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;04000.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>4&#160;000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstads_DFF\" title=\"Kristianstads DFF\">Kristianstads DFF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstad\" title=\"Kristianstad\">Kristianstad</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Vilans_IP&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Vilans IP [inte skriven än]\">Vilans IP</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;05000.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>5&#160;000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköpings FC</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6ping\" title=\"Linköping\">Linköping</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6ping_Arena\" title=\"Linköping Arena\">Arena Linköping</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;08400.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>8&#160;400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF_Dam\" title=\"Piteå IF Dam\">Piteå IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5\" title=\"Piteå\">Piteå</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/LF_Arena\" title=\"LF Arena\">LF Arena</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;03000.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>3&#160;000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tyres%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Tyresö FF\">Tyresö FF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tyres%C3%B6_kommun\" title=\"Tyresö kommun\">Tyresö</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tyres%C3%B6vallen\" title=\"Tyresövallen\">Tyresövallen</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;03500.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>3&#160;500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå IK</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5\" title=\"Umeå\">Umeå</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/T3_Arena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"T3 Arena\">T3 Arena</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;08000.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>8&#160;000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6_GIK\" title=\"Vittsjö GIK\">Vittsjö GIK</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6\" title=\"Vittsjö\">Vittsjö</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Vittsj%C3%B6_IP&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Vittsjö IP [inte skriven än]\">Vittsjö IP</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;03000.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>3&#160;000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top&quot;\">\n<div style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:284px;padding:4px;border:1px solid silver;margin:4px;background-color:white\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid silver;padding:0px;width:280px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Sweden_location_map.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Sweden_location_map.svg/330px-Sweden_location_map.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"280\" height=\"611\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Sweden_location_map.svg/96